OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA wet and windy start, with
OL,6,Fheavy and blustery outbreaks of rain.
OL,7,FCloud clears and wind eases by late
OL,8,Fmorning, with a bright and sunny day
OL,9,Fto follow. Showers developing, mainly
OL,10,Facross the Pennines, later in the
OL,11,Fafternoon.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FCloudy periods and staying
OL,14,Fdry for most, although isolated
OL,15,Fshowers remain possible. Mist or fog
OL,16,Fpatches forming in places as the wind
OL,17,Fremains light. Feeling cooler
OL,18,Fovernight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
