OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FSunny spells throughout the
OL,6,Fday and remaining dry for most. The
OL,7,Fsouthwesterly wind strengthens for a
OL,8,Ftime during the afternoon.
OL,9,FTemperatures remain slightly above
OL,10,Faverage in places.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FBreezy
OL,13,Fwith outbreaks of rain on Friday.
OL,14,FCloudy periods on Saturday. Cloudy
OL,15,Fwith perhaps rain in places on Sunday.
OL,16,FTemperatures around or slightly above
OL,17,Faverage.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
